+! Pre-orient the structure externally so local x is parallel to [11-2]
+! and local z is parallel to [111].
+! With dt=2 fs and shear rate 0.001 ps^-1:
+!   dgamma = 0.001 ps^-1 * 0.002 ps = 2.0d-6 per MD step.
+! With caimd_stride=10, 10000 events correspond to 100000 MD steps and
+! gamma=0.20 via F_load(1,3)=0.20.
